  ok    the renewal IS a second lease — lease identity resolved separately

── H2  a bed transfer must not mint another human ────────────────────
  ok    one person across a bed change

── H3  two different humans with identical names stay distinct ───────
  ok    TWO persons, not one — a shared name never collapses anyone

── H4  same source record, contradictory strong evidence → refuses ───
  ok    disposition is CONFLICTED, not a winner-takes-all pick
